  "historyUrl": "https://hayday.fandom.com/wiki/Chamomile?action=history",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/31/Chamomile.png/revision/latest?cb=20241209180843\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Chamomile\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chamomile\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"153\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Chamomile</figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\"><a href=\"/wiki/crops-3568\" title=\"Crops\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Crop</a></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e1/Experience.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160312141717\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> Exp. lvl(s) 45</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f0/Coins.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160223180814\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 1 to 10</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>time</span><span title=\"Production/Building time\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"time\"><img alt=\"time\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/35/Clock.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160228103426\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>  20 min</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 2</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Source </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>Farm</span><span title=\"Field(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/farm-15139\" title=\"Farm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Farm\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color pi-collapse pi-collapse-closed\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">+</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Default: </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 3</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Also: </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 2</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br>\n<b>Chamomile</b> is a field <a href=\"/wiki/crops-3568\" title=\"Crops\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">crop</a> unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level 45. This plant is added in Winter 2024 update.\n</p><p>It is used to make <a href=\"/wiki/soothing-pad-36215\" title=\"Soothing Pad\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">soothing pads</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/chamomile-tea-36214\" title=\"Chamomile Tea\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">chamomile tea</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/chamomile-essential-oil-36213\" title=\"Chamomile Essential Oil\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">chamomile essential oil</a>.\n</p><p>Like all crops, it is stored in the <a href=\"/wiki/silo-2654\" title=\"Silo\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">silo</a>.\n</p><p>If you have none in your silo, you can buy 10 for 170 <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Growing chamomile</b></span></h3>\n<p>Chamomile is grown in <a href=\"/wiki/farm-15139\" title=\"Farm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">fields</a> by planting another chamomile (either previously harvested or purchased). Each plot yields 2 plants (net gain of 1 plant) and 2 <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> points, and takes twenty minutes to mature.\n</p>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AChamomile_Stage_1.png\" title=\"Chamomile Stage 1.png (133 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f0/Chamomile_Stage_1.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20250120212559\" title=\"Chamomile Stage 1.png (133 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Chamomile Stage 1.png (133 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AChamomile_Stage_2.png\" title=\"Chamomile Stage 2.png (169 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/4/42/Chamomile_Stage_2.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20250120212608\" title=\"Chamomile Stage 2.png (169 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Chamomile Stage 2.png (169 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AChamomile_Stage_3.png\" title=\"Chamomile Stage 3.png (256 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/d/da/Chamomile_Stage_3.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20250120212619\" title=\"Chamomile Stage 3.png (256 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Chamomile Stage 3.png (256 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AChamomile_Stage_4.png\" title=\"Chamomile Stage 4.png (331 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/9/99/Chamomile_Stage_4.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20250120212628\" title=\"Chamomile Stage 4.png (331 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Chamomile Stage 4.png (331 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AChamomile_Stage_5.png\" title=\"Chamomile Stage 5.png (173 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/c/c9/Chamomile_Stage_5.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20250120212639\" title=\"Chamomile Stage 5.png (173 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Chamomile Stage 5.png (173 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Selling chamomile</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/0/09/Roadside_Shop.png/revision/latest?cb=20191028143054\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Roadside Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Roadside Shop\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Roadside Shop</figcaption></figure>\n<ul><li>Chamomile can be sold or bought for a maximum price of 108 <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> for 10 units.</li></ul>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Using chamomile</b></span></h3>\n<p>Chamomile is used to make the following <a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">products</a>:\n</p><p><br>\n</p>\n<table>\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/soothing-pad-36215\" title=\"Soothing pad\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Soothing pad\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"33\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/chamomile-essential-oil-36213\" title=\"Chamomile essential oil\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chamomile essential oil\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"123\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/chamomile-tea-36214\" title=\"Chamomile tea\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chamomile tea\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"71\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/soothing-pad-36215\" title=\"Soothing Pad\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Soothing Pad</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/chamomile-essential-oil-36213\" title=\"Chamomile Essential Oil\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Chamomile Essential<br>Oil</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/chamomile-tea-36214\" title=\"Chamomile Tea\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Chamomile Tea</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/31/Chamomile.png/revision/latest?cb=20241209180843\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chamomile\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"38\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span><b>x5</b>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/31/Chamomile.png/revision/latest?cb=20241209180843\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chamomile\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"38\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span><b>x5</b>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/31/Chamomile.png/revision/latest?cb=20241209180843\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chamomile\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"38\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span><b>x5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 45\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 74\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 100\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Boat orders</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"/wiki/boat-2675\" title=\"Riverboat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Riverboat\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Riverboat</figcaption></figure>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/boat-2675\" title=\"Boat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Boat</a> orders ask for 32 to 47 chamomile flowers per crate, up to a total of 144 per boat.</li>\n<li>Each unit of chamomile gives players 5 coins and 3 experience points in boat orders.</li></ul>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Strategy tips</b></span></h3>\n<ul><li>Recipes ask for up to 5 chamomile flowers. Make sure you have enough in your <a href=\"/wiki/silo-2654\" title=\"Silo\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">silo</a>.</li></ul>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"navmenutitle\">See also</div><div class=\"navmenubox\">\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-center wikia-gallery-spacing-small wikia-gallery-border-none wikia-gallery-captions-center wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/asparagus-35799\" title=\"Asparagus (2.42 MB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/4/45/Asparagus.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20240218150229\" title=\"Asparagus (2.42 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Asparagus (2.42 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/beetroot-33002\" title=\"Beetroot (3.94 MB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/5/56/Beetroot.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/47?cb=20240218150336\" title=\"Beetroot (3.94 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Beetroot (3.94 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" 